%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c2fae37d383e5cb4abb0c0daa9b84e3a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogos LVL1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  frases:
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: 'To Cedric and Thalya:

      

      If you are reading these words,
      it means our worst fears have been realized.

'
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: The Sage Ares has betrayed our order's oath. He has stolen the Soul
      Bridge, the forbidden relic capable of opening portals between dimensions.
      For centuries, the Sages used it to seal the Realm of Exile, a place where
      corrupted souls and beings whose evil threatened the world were imprisoned.
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: 'But Ares has shattered the balance.

'
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: 'Portals have begun to open across the lands. Forgotten creatures, born
      of hatred and eternal damnation, return once more to our world.

'
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: "\rWe do not know their true intentions. Perhaps they seek power. Perhaps
      vengeance. Perhaps something worse.\n"
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: 'You must depart immediately for the Temple of Elyndar. Our records
      speak of ancient secrets hidden there; artifacts from other realities and mysteries
      beyond imagination. The fate of the kingdom has already begun to unravel.

'
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  - nombrePersonaje: Mysterious letter
    lafrase: "May the spirits of the forest protect you.\r\n\r\n\u2014 The Great
      Council of the Wise\r\n\n"
    Icono: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7f89ec0345b46204ba58610ce062575b, type: 3}
  Cooldowns:
  - 0.5
  - 0.5
  - 0.5
  - 0.5
  - 0.5
  - 0.5
  - 0.5
